					<description><![CDATA[<p>After years of admiring from a distance, I&#8217;ve finally taken the plunge into the world of 3D printing, and what a world it is! My journey begins with the highly-acclaimed Bambu Labs X1 Carbon, a machine that promises speed, multi-color printing, and a level of precision that feels almost like magic. The future of making [&#8230;]</p>
