					<description><![CDATA[<p>I&#8217;m excited to share a new Python tool I&#8217;ve developed,&#160;SignalGenerator. This script is specifically designed with embedded systems in mind, providing a simple yet powerful way to generate and test audio waveforms. While it works on any system with PyAudio, its real value shines when used with hardware like the&#160;Raspberry Pi 4&#8217;s onboard digital-to-analog converter [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.scmakes.com/projects/engineering/signal-generator/">Signal Generator</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.scmakes.com/">SC Makes</a>.</p>
